WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.668
Is real family money moving through banks right now, and when does Pay-it-Forward start?

2
00:00:05.668 --> 00:00:09.661
Today is Phase I Paper Mode—zero live bank money is connected.

3
00:00:09.661 --> 00:00:13.397
Phase I is flight simulator training on live weather data.

4
00:00:13.397 --> 00:00:19.065
Only after discipline is proven does Phase II turn on separate IFAS bank custody and the

5
00:00:19.065 --> 00:00:21.577
Familial Stability Advance Pool (FSAP),

6
00:00:21.577 --> 00:00:25.441
where stable relatives help clear high-interest family debt.

7
00:00:25.441 --> 00:00:31.045
Pay-it-Forward advances are revolving family stewardship agreements tracked in separate

8
00:00:31.045 --> 00:00:36.648
accounting—never automatic deductions from another relative’s personal trading account.
